    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567600/extras/d89b19e83c36146590c0891a5c8d80bf.poster.avif?t=1753935912\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567600/extras/d89b19e83c36146590c0891a5c8d80bf.webm?t=1753935912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567600/extras/d89b19e83c36146590c0891a5c8d80bf.mp4?t=1753935912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ levels of increasing difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use grappling and bounce pads to build momentum and fly through each level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more to discover on your <strong>Icoptic Journey</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567600/extras/d89b19e83c36146590c0891a5c8d80bf.poster.avif?t=1753935912\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567600/extras/d89b19e83c36146590c0891a5c8d80bf.webm?t=1753935912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567600/extras/d89b19e83c36146590c0891a5c8d80bf.mp4?t=1753935912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ levels of increasing difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use grappling and bounce pads to build momentum and fly through each level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more to discover on your <strong>Icoptic Journey</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
